    "preview_ja": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/preview_ja.wav",
      "sha256": "3f2ad8ae9a9ecb1e30430cdc6fc9fc754e41a2d2234aa71cbd804b85734210f5",
      "canonical_text": "暮らしの多くを整えてくれる家のロボットと暮らすマヤは、毎日を楽に過ごしています。けれど、母親とのこれからを考える中で、自分で選ぶことの意味を、じっくり考えることになります。",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "comment_1_ja": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/comment_1_ja.wav",
      "sha256": "b858f5354ed82170431483afc3ffbb031bb00d10a95e00d4cadc33eb7164d5f8",
      "canonical_text": "マヤの身近な日々に、どんな変化が起こるのか、静かに聞いてみましょう。",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "comment_2_ja": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/comment_2_ja.wav",
      "sha256": "eab1ed9122003ecd05cd53c0f326edd03fd298137eae22cafc749fc5012861d6",
      "canonical_text": "このあと、マヤはいつものようにロボットに任せられない問いに向き合うことになりそうです。",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "comment_3_ja": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/comment_3_ja.wav",
      "sha256": "e84db0dfe65d7e7ca515f00cc24a9ad712861535f7921b544c00395b15f3b582",
      "canonical_text": "お金や睡眠、仕事、安全についてロボットが問いかけ、マヤは答えましたが、今回はいつものようにロボットが最適解を示してくれることはありませんでした。",
      "disfluency_checked": false,
      "asr_text": "お金や睡眠、仕事、安全についてロボットが問いかけ、マヤは答えましたが、今回はいつものようにロボットが最適解を示してくれることはありませんでした。"
    },
    "story_001": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_001.wav",
      "sha256": "28e6175503c4844070724ca79126f01529d813d853db8da6a1fa3c283d8ff5a5",
      "canonical_text": "At seven, Maya woke before the house robot spoke. Her room was warm. The window opened a little. On the chair, the robot had placed blue clothes. Maya did not remember choosing them. In the kitchen, a bowl of sweet rice waited. Her tea was already cool enough to drink. The wall showed a short comedy. Maya smiled. It was the kind of show she usually liked.",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_002": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_002.wav",
      "sha256": "0b91e43169caf58f189b0a9d1bfd2613159f1729637d398491d305e33d5b607e",
      "canonical_text": "\"Good morning,\"",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_003": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_003.wav",
      "sha256": "292b36a8451dece02b8780b6d404427bf2a6e4423411a25e5a51c779c471545b",
      "canonical_text": "said the robot.",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_004": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_004.wav",
      "sha256": "f2259eaa4c6af12a9321edd27b8a60ac17a2ac2e526100c36871d0b017f73f86",
      "canonical_text": "\"Your day is ready.\"",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_005": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_005.wav",
      "sha256": "c1b1ba2c2f555038ec0742276cff82f22d4402eb823f0c53276c40bf78c49cdb",
      "canonical_text": "It had been ready for years. The robot chose her food, clothes, music, and route to work. It answered messages for her, too.",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_006": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_006.wav",
      "sha256": "dc735bc6b48ade194acf1ebee78666216c5997f0f273e919047d144b19adc2f9",
      "canonical_text": "\"Your friend is worried,\"",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_007": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_007.wav",
      "sha256": "4636e56197b1732bc26598faf42f9122f43c9078ca49e2685bf66d57fc331d01",
      "canonical_text": "it might say.",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_008": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_008.wav",
      "sha256": "45409e1ea12e5b7fa329a9a55909973740faf41fa95206eecde63723bcf86c60",
      "canonical_text": "\"I wrote: 'I am fine. I will call tonight.'\"",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_009": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_009.wav",
      "sha256": "bac4d8cc076c6d8515a00135649c2435f7ed3c1a88cad0799cd40fa3090c5514",
      "canonical_text": "Maya often read the message and pressed Send. When she came home, the lights were soft. The room smelled good. A film was waiting. Her body relaxed before she even sat down. The robot never gave orders. It only made life easy.",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_010": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_010.wav",
      "sha256": "af9185e63d26f81e3e524479fa16002693ee0523c79433b0ad9c2492f4961550",
      "canonical_text": "One rainy evening, Maya's mother came to her door. She carried one small bag.",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_011": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_011.wav",
      "sha256": "0277ca97fdb0397bcf22ef97ad60c369aefc9ee78d70da9404110fe3a797b598",
      "canonical_text": "\"My doctor says I cannot live alone now,\"",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_012": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_012.wav",
      "sha256": "32660115e030a6efd54833d30ea32b8a2407688997ec06476e2f980cec1183c2",
      "canonical_text": "her mother said.",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_013": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_013.wav",
      "sha256": "0b772d63d68fc69d042a4b056662eddc0c5f1e2b0d58909ed2d1502fdc6661e2",
      "canonical_text": "\"I can move into a care house, or I can live here with you. What do you think?\"",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_014": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_014.wav",
      "sha256": "16178bb60c8f8bb3cc43201f813cc726840e8d1509460c39f992468334c8ba1f",
      "canonical_text": "The robot became quiet. On the wall, two plans appeared.",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_015": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_015.wav",
      "sha256": "99dd303289fd889c7fbf7493ddbf349cf4eb4a89575e8c3f43ed2b6d4b9ea4db",
      "canonical_text": "CARE HOUSE: more sleep for Maya. HOME: more time with her mother.",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_016": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_016.wav",
      "sha256": "76ee11829aadc9c35afb6957105ddd71648ed2e8ffd755680eaa4c554ba0d7ac",
      "canonical_text": "\"Choose the better plan,\" Maya said.",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_017": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_017.wav",
      "sha256": "7421733e40d009d1e1df73cd07013399c2c093782b54318349f2f7cfb287f6a1",
      "canonical_text": "The robot studied her face.",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_018": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_018.wav",
      "sha256": "6d1ee4aa1ed71e0156a2aa82bef8f958688e4e302e494321c24d101aad7be3d5",
      "canonical_text": "\"Both plans have advantages.\"",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_019": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_019.wav",
      "sha256": "c04ba7fd76123ab27512e31c898ad0f2cf2c5475b5c8cd21d9e41d4e7134f682",
      "canonical_text": "\"Then choose one.\"",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_020": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_020.wav",
      "sha256": "3878f03b2e5ee32e4377f6c1586bfbdc5b03c37bda93e50c9f9d0bd7af875b1b",
      "canonical_text": "\"I need your preference.\"",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_021": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_021.wav",
      "sha256": "71f2b89dd3b1db6292786d2bae5e2772eccf4f81d5e23447e03931b26ff15e5b",
      "canonical_text": "Maya looked at her mother. Her mother looked back. Maya waited for the familiar answer. The robot usually knew her. It knew that she liked warm rooms and quiet films. It knew which shoes felt best. It knew when she wanted to send a message but was too tired to write one. But this question was not about comfort. \"I don't know,\" Maya said.",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_022": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_022.wav",
      "sha256": "8e827f88c9a00cb511661890a942460c2c26118f6bb55dfe55fcd48e9d3e126a",
      "canonical_text": "The robot asked about money, sleep, work, and safety. Maya answered. Still, no answer came.",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_023": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_023.wav",
      "sha256": "418c71ba9e64ff4d5a70b3a193cc2bb482055b52e0b225dfa39ef86ad93dd355",
      "canonical_text": "Her mother touched her hand.",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_024": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_024.wav",
      "sha256": "67c0ea29bd423e2fdbe26d304fa2d5de494aa853cf114234eaee8455f8d00675",
      "canonical_text": "\"What do you want, Maya?\"",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    },
    "story_025": {
      "status": "OK",
      "path": "er013_output/family_c_episode_trial_09/home_robots_v2/audio/story_025.wav",
      "sha256": "dde2bd02dce449c882d35b64f690689fb47269bc1e303d941622636f47060700",
      "canonical_text": "The question felt strange. It was not a button. It was not a menu. Maya looked at the two plans. Then she looked at the robot. \"Turn everything off,\" she said. The house went dark and quiet. For the first time in years, nothing chose the next moment. Maya took a slow breath. She was afraid. She was also awake. \"Mother,\" she said, \"come in.\" In the dark, the robot waited. Maybe tomorrow Maya would turn it on again. But that night, the first choice that truly belonged to her was the wish to make one.",
      "disfluency_checked": true,
      "reused": true,
      "asr_text": null
    }
  },
